  "answer": "To declare a reusable dependency with `Depends` in FastAPI, you can define a function that will be used as a dependency. This function can be called within your path operation function using the `Depends` function. Here is an example:\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import Depends, FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\ndef get_current_active_user(current_user: str = Depends(...)):\n    # Your logic to check if the user is active\n    return current_user\n\n@app.get(\"/users/me/items/\")\nasync def read_items(current_user: str = Depends(get_current_active_user)):\n    # Your logic to read items\n    pass\n```\n\nThis example is derived from the documentation in [reference/dependencies-1].",
